{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"REM Skapa str\u00E4ngarray med SPLIT$\nDIM parts$(4)\nparts$ = SPLIT$(\u0022Anna,Erik,Lisa,Kalle\u0022, \u0022,\u0022)\n\nREM Skriv ut enskilda element\nFOR I=0 TO DIM(parts$)-1\n  PRINT parts$(i)\nNEXT I\n\n\nREM Sl\u00E5 ihop igen med JOIN$\nresult$ = JOIN$(parts$, \u0022 och \u0022)\nPRINT result$  ; \u0022Anna och Erik och Lisa och Kalle\u0022\n\nREM Funkar \u00E4ven med numeriska arrayer\nDIM numbers(3)\nnumbers(0) = 100\nnumbers(1) = 200\nnumbers(2) = 300\n\ncsv$ = JOIN$(numbers, \u0022,\u0022)\nPRINT csv$  ; \u0022100,200,300\u0022\n\nREM Dela upp en mening\nDIM words$(20)\nwords$ = SPLIT$(\u0022Detta \u00E4r ett test s\u00E5 det s\u00E5\u0022, \u0022 \u0022)\nFOR i = 0 TO DIM(words$)-1\n    PRINT i \u0026 \u0022: \u0022 \u0026 words$(i)\nNEXT i","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}